OL,3,AGTA 6 breaks records as sales top $2bn
OL,4,A- industry estimate
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 is estimated to have
OL,7,Fbecome the biggest entertainment
OL,8,Frelease in history following the
OL,9,Fblockbuster video game's launch on
OL,10,FThursday, after a 13-year wait.
OL,12,FThe highly anticipated open-world
OL,13,Faction-adventure has sold more than
OL,14,F24.5 million units as of Thursday,
OL,15,Fraking in about $2.36bn (#1.8bn),
OL,16,Faccording to analytics platform Sensor
OL,17,FTower.
OL,19,FIn comparison, this year's highest
OL,20,Fgrossing movie so far, Spider-Man:
OL,21,FBrand New Day, made $2.5bn over its
OL,22,Fentire run in cinemas.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
