OL,3,AGTA 6 breaks records as sales top $2bn
OL,4,A- industry estimate
OL,5,
OL,6,FGTA 6's maker Rockstar and parent
OL,7,Fcompany Take-Two have not released
OL,8,Fdetails of the game's sales but said
OL,9,Fdemand has been "unprecedented". The
OL,10,FBBC has contacted both the firms for
OL,11,Fcomment.
